                            GN  1 : perfectly conducting PEC (epsilon/sigma fields ignored)            
                            GN  2 : real ground, Sommerfeld/Norton                                     
                                     F1 = relative permittivity epsilon_r                              
                                          dry soil=3  average=13  wet=20  sea water=80                 
