                                |     |       |     |     |       |     +---------- THETA increment (de
                                |     |       |     |     |       +---------------- PHI start (deg)    
                                |     |       |     |     +------------------------ THETA start (deg)  
                                |     |       |     |       0=zenith  90=horizon                       
                                |     |       |     +------------------------------ XNDA output format 
                                |     |       |       1000=power gain dBi no norm  0000=normalised     
                                |     |       +------------------------------------ NPHI: phi steps    
